THIS DOES NOT APPLY TO THE GAME OR ITS ASSETS
---------------------------------------------
"L'Éternel Retour: Death Gamble", its code, and its bundled art and audio are NOT covered by this dedication
and are not redistributable. This waiver covers only what is in this repository: the documentation, the
example configuration and scripts, and the generated placeholder sprites.

A mod you build must ship art and audio you have the right to distribute. Do not extract or redistribute the
game's assets.
